-- AUTHORITATIVE BASE SCHEMA
-- ============================================================================
-- This file is the base schema: tables, indexes, triggers, and the RLS policy set named in
-- supabase/README.md. Apply it to an empty project, then apply supabase/migrations/* in order.
--
